+    # ---- SCOPE AND POWER OF THE SHIPPED-BUDGET VERDICT, hoisted (adversarial review 2026-07-26) ---
+    # The b400 safety verdict is decided by ONE GAME and its decisive gap by ONE SEED, and 4 of 75
